Eh, amazing, there are so many different colors. I mean, you can't really tell dinosaur colors from their bones.

1212
01:19:20,720 --> 01:19:22,620
そりゃそうだよね、無理だよね。
That's true, right? It's impossible.

1213
01:19:22,720 --> 01:19:25,920
そうそうそう。だから赤いプテラもしからしたらいたのかも?
Yeah, yeah, yeah. So maybe there actually was a red Pteranodon?

1214
01:19:24,120 --> 01:19:26,620
そうよ、もしかしたらいたかもしれないよ。
That's right, maybe there was one.

1215
01:19:27,120 --> 01:19:30,120
