Hey, cool phoenix.

1216
01:19:30,620 --> 01:19:33,620
えー、みたい。いったん入ってみよう。いろんなプテラ。
Eh, I want to see. Let's go in for a bit. Various Pteranodons.

1217
01:19:34,120 --> 01:19:36,620
楽しみだね、ソフィア。
I'm looking forward to it, Sophia.

