1219
01:19:41,620 --> 01:19:42,620
助かるねー。
That helps so much.

1220
01:19:42,720 --> 01:19:48,120
テイムで迷ったらじゃあソフィアに聞いてさ、直接聞いてさ、そう、何が好きか書いてるよ全部。
If you get stuck on taming, you can ask Sophia directly, yeah, it writes everything about what they like.

1221
01:19:49,120 --> 01:19:51,620
すげえじゃんマジで図鑑。
That's seriously amazing, the encyclopedia.

1222
01:19:52,120 --> 01:19:56,120
おすすめを恐竜図鑑。ずっと見てて楽しいしね。
The recommended dinosaur encyclopedia. It's fun to look at all the time.

1223
01:19:57,120 --> 01:19:59,120
